      "source": [
        "# Gemini Omni Flash: Capabilities and Prompting\n",
        "\n",
        "Omni generates and edits video through the **Interactions API**. Every call, generation\n",
        "and editing alike, goes through `client.interactions.create`, and edits chain together with\n",
        "`previous_interaction_id`. This notebook covers how to prompt it and every major capability:\n",
        "text to video, world-knowledge visualization, text rendering, audio, conversational editing,\n",
        "image to video, interpolation, subject reference, editing your own clip, and multi-turn\n",
        "scene editing.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "fe3d8706",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "fe3d8706"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Setup"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
