        "## 5. Editing through conversation (the headline)\n",
        "Generate once, then refine. Each turn passes `previous_interaction_id`; you send only the new\n",
        "instruction and the prior video is carried forward. Watch one clip evolve: add an effect, then\n",
        "redirect the camera, then change the whole style. Use real videography words for the camera\n",
        "(push in, dolly zoom, locked off, oner, close-up, tilt up, widen)."
      ]
